#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:264
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:266
msgid ""
"The spec is immutable after creation; create another resource to change an "
"action, selector, or lifecycle policy. Separate pipeline stages, arbitrary "
"lifecycle hooks, workload or rollout gating, autoscaler mutation, and "
"workload-derived targets remain out of scope. Custom actions are finite Job "
"work, not a general-purpose deployment or orchestration framework. Deleting "
"and recreating a Continuous resource deletes its owned coverage ledger and "
"warms every currently authorized target again."
msgstr ""
"spec 创建后不可变；如需更改操作、选择器或生命周期策略，请创建新的资源。独立的"
"流水线阶段、任意生命周期钩子、工作负载或发布门禁、自动扩缩容器变更，以及从工"
"作负载派生目标，仍不在支持范围内。自定义操作是有限的 Job 工作，而非通用部署或"
"编排框架。删除并重新创建 Continuous 资源会删除其所属的覆盖 ledger，并重新预热"
"所有当前已授权目标。"

