#~ msgid ""
#~ "``ModelWarmup`` performs a finite ``Once`` warmup Job on each selected "
#~ "Kubernetes node. A resource can be image-only, custom-only, or combined: "
#~ "image entries make the runtime pull an image and run a safe finite "
#~ "command; custom actions can check a node or download an artifact; a "
#~ "combined action does both. It does not start an inference engine or gate "
#~ "workloads."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``ModelWarmup`` 会在每个选定的 Kubernetes 节点上执行一次有限的 ``Once`` 预"
#~ "热 Job。资源可以仅包含镜像、仅包含自定义操作，也可以将二者组合：镜像条目会"
#~ "让容器运行时拉取镜像并运行一条可安全结束的命令；自定义操作可以检查节点或下"
#~ "载制品；组合操作则同时完成这两项工作。它不会启动推理引擎，也不会用作工作负"
#~ "载门禁。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "``Succeeded`` is a point-in-time aggregate Job result. Kubelet or runtime "
#~ "image garbage collection can evict pulled images, and node replacement, "
#~ "cleanup, or storage failures can remove host-path model artifacts. Use "
#~ "immutable image and model references when reproducibility matters, and "
#~ "retain a durable artifact source for production workloads."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``Succeeded`` 是某一时点的聚合 Job 结果。Kubelet 或容器运行时的镜像垃圾回"
#~ "收可能清除已拉取的镜像，而节点替换、清理或存储故障可能移除主机路径中的模型"
#~ "制品。需要可重现性时，请使用不可变的镜像和模型引用，并为生产工作负载保留持"
#~ "久的制品来源。"

